 "title": "24AA01/24LC01B: 1 Kbit (128 x 8) I²C serial EEPROM",
 "source": {
  "document": "DS21711J",
  "revision": "DS21711J, 2009",
  "pages": 34
 },
 "summary": "A 1 Kbit serial EEPROM organised as 128 bytes, read and written over a two-wire I²C-compatible bus at 100 kHz or 400 kHz, with an 8-byte page write, a write-protect pin and a self-timed write cycle of 5 ms max. The 24AA01 works from 1.7 V and the 24LC01B from 2.5 V, both up to 5.5 V; the address pins A0 to A2 have no internal connection. It comes in 8-lead PDIP, SOIC, TSSOP, MSOP, DFN and TDFN and in 5-lead SOT-23 and SC-70. 24LC01BT-I/SN is the 24LC01B, industrial range, in the 8-lead SOIC on tape and reel.",
